  "pseudoCode": "FUNCTION numDecodings(s):\n    IF s[0] == '0' THEN RETURN 0\n    dp = ARRAY_OF_SIZE(LENGTH(s) + 1, INITIAL_VALUE = 0)\n    dp[0] = 1, dp[1] = 1\n    FOR i FROM 2 TO LENGTH(s) DO:\n        one = INT(SUBSTRING(s, i-1, i))\n        two = INT(SUBSTRING(s, i-2, i))\n        IF one >= 1 THEN dp[i] = dp[i] + dp[i-1]\n        IF two >= 10 AND two <= 26 THEN dp[i] = dp[i] + dp[i-2]\n    END FOR\n    RETURN dp[LENGTH(s)]\nEND FUNCTION",
